== Identified risks and security issues

.Instructions
[%collapsible]
=====
[NOTE]
====
When reviewing the lists of identified risks and security issues, check that

* Threat modelling was performed in an acceptable level of detail, taking into account possible impacts of cybersecurity risks to the health and safety of users
* According to your best current understanding, all relevant findings have been listed
* The identified risks and security issues have been processed and treatment plans have been documented
* The planned treatment minimise cybersecurity risks, prevent cybersecurity incidents and minimize the impacts of such incidents.

Note that implementing the treatment plan is not part of threat model review.
====
=====

